Super IRCam Qt GUI
Copyright 2026 Sertac Tulluk <stulluk@gmail.com>

This repository is a Qt desktop GUI for Qianli Super IRCam / InfiRay-family
USB thermal cameras. The live thermal feature set (colormaps, overlays,
rulers, AVI recording, radiometry) follows Thermal-Camera-Redux:

  https://github.com/92es/Thermal-Camera-Redux

and its upstream Python project PyThermalCamera:

  https://github.com/leswright1977/PyThermalCamera

We did not relicense Thermal-Camera-Redux. All prior licenses of
Thermal-Camera-Redux and PyThermalCamera continue to apply to that work.
This tree is only the Qt GUI and Debian packaging around the same public
UVC radiometry format (YUYV 256x384, T°C = raw/64 − 273.15).

No implied or expressed usability guarantee or warranty. Use at your own risk.

The original Qt GUI and packaging files in this repository are offered
under the MIT License.

